# Media originals. The pipeline (scripts/media.mjs --archive) moves every
# downloaded JPEG/PNG here after encoding, so public/ holds only what ships.
# 46 MB of source photography does not belong in git history; the encoded WebP
# in public/ is the deliverable and IS committed. Keep a copy of this folder if
# you ever need to re-encode at a different size.
media-src/
